$ curl -i http://127.0.0.1:3000/greeting
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
content-length: 43

hello, guest: sign up for a key to see more

$ curl -i -H 'x-api-key: letmein' http://127.0.0.1:3000/greeting
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
content-length: 51

hello, member "letmein": here are today's new books

$ curl -i -H 'x-api-key: guess' http://127.0.0.1:3000/greeting
HTTP/1.1 403 Forbidden
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
content-length: 13

wrong API key
